ress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692168/4c9f8bf7-f9a9-412d-a48d-748d1caae064.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692168/4c9f8bf7-f9a9-412d-a48d-748d1caae064.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692168/4c9f8bf7-f9a9-412d-a48d-748d1caae064.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"NEW: Air-conditioned, fully furnished maisonette apartment, Electric Car charging Station, perfectly located\n\nEntire apartment\n\nExclusive, fully furnished maisonette apartment with air conditioning and a homely feel – all-inclusive rent!\n\nThis charming, newly renovated maisonette apartment with its own entrance offers a modern, fully equipped temporary home – ideal for singles or couples seeking comfort and peace in a central location.\n\n️Fully furnished (ready to move in!) and high comfort thanks to air conditioning!\n\nFully furnished: including bed, couch, dining table, etc.\n\nFitted kitchen with dishes, cutlery, pots, etc.\n\nTV, sound system, washing machine (optional), Wi-Fi (optional)\n\nHighly efficient air conditioning (built in 2024) with pollen and air filter\n\nGas heating\n\nElectric car charging station directly in front of the house\n\nLocation – quiet, central & close to nature\n\nThe apartment is located in a well-kept part of Horn-Bad Meinberg with an upscale neighborhood and excellent infrastructure:\n\n100m to a bakery, restaurants & pharmacy, ice cream parlor, etc.\n\n300m to a supermarket, 700m to an outdoor pool\n\n200m to the central bus station\n\n9km to Detmold, 25km to Paderborn\n\n1.5km to the Externsteine rock formations and hiking trails\n\n\nRent & Conditions:\n\nElectricity is available separately via a separate contract or by arrangement\n\nShort-term rentals possible\n\nNo pets (depending on the apartment)\n\nMove in & feel at home – you just need to bring your clothes.\n\nAdditional Information\n\nWelcome to your fully equipped maisonette apartment – high-quality, fully furnished, and equipped with the latest technology.\n\nThis newly renovated 50m2 apartment in Horn-Bad Meinberg is perfect for commuters, hospital staff, project workers, or guests seeking a temporary solution with a feel-good factor.\n\n\n✅ Apartment Highlights:\n\nModern air conditioning (installed in 2024) with pollen and air filters\n\nSeparate entrance, like a private semi-detached house\n\nFully furnished and ready to move in: including TV, sound system, washing machine (optional), bed linens, towels, kitchen equipment, etc.\n\nFast Wi-Fi (optional) and a quiet working atmosphere\n\nPrivate kitchen and bathroom, bedroom and living area spread over two floors\n\nElectric charging station (wallbox) at the house – ideal for electric car drivers\n\nQuiet location in a well-maintained neighborhood\n\nFree parking directly in front of the house\n\n🏞️ Location & Surroundings:\n\nThe apartment is just a few minutes from the city center, with excellent infrastructure and close proximity to:\n\nClinics and rehabilitation centers\n\nBakeries, supermarkets, pharmacies, and restaurants (all within walking distance)\n\nPure nature: only 1.5 km to the Externsteine rock formations and hiking trails\n\n10 minutes to Detmold, 25 minutes to Paderborn\n\n💶 Rent (Rent including all utilities except electricity)","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"yes"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"